    "title": "First Warning Forecast: Tracking rare level 4/5 severe weather threat Monday",
    "text": "___ Police believe Marwa Barakzai has run away, deploying significant resources to finding her WeatherToday's Forecast Actions Facebook Tweet Email First Warning Forecast: Tracking rare level 4/5 severe weather threat Monday — tornadoes possible We haven't seen a level 4/5 threat since 2021. We have another one in effect for tomorrow. Damaging winds and tornados will be possible. Prev Next Severe storms are battering areas of Hampton Roads, with trees falling, thunderstorms warnings and even two tornado warnings occurring Monday afternoon. By: Derrah Getter Posted 11:24 PM, Mar 15, 2026 and last updated 8:27 PM, Mar 16, 2026 Derrah Getter's First Warning ForecastThis evening will be partly cloudy and mild. Lows tonight fall into the mid to upper 50s.A level 4 out of 5 severe weather threat is in place for parts of the area Monday. The last time we saw level 4 threat was 5 years ago in 2021. Widespread strong to severe storms will be capable of producing damaging wind gusts and tornadoes. Storms will start to intensify around noon and continue through 7 pm. Wind gusts 40-60+ mph will be possible. 1/1 Skip Ad Continue watchingafter the adVisit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEMake sure you have a way to get weather alerts in your area. Highs will be in the 70s on Monday, which will help fuel the storms. Behind the strong storm system, temperatures will be much cooler on St. Patrick’s Day Tuesday with highs in the 40s and 50s. Temperatures gradually rebound closer to average by the end of the week. Let's connect on social media!Forecaster Derrah Getter:For weather updates on Facebook: HEREFor weather updates on X: HEREFollow me on Instagram: HERECheck out the Interactive Radar on WTKR.com: Interactive Radar Recommended For You Marketplace Sell Your Items - Free to List Visit Full Marketplace 1959 Cadillac Eldorado $249,000 Gateway C. | sellwild.com 1929 Ford Model A Pickup Gateway C. | sellwild.com 1979 Pontiac Trans Am $33,000 Gateway C. | sellwild.com 2025 Ho